From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:57:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] carriersettings: take the ims sip and registration
 settings from samsung

the pixel configs keep aosp defaults for the sip transaction timers,
the registration and subscription expiry, the registration retry
timers, the sip transport and the ipsec algorithms, while the stock
samsung ims sets them per operator. airtel in, for example, registers
for 600000 seconds here against 14400 on stock.

copy every value the operator's stock volte profile sets explicitly
over the pixel config, ringing, ringback and session timers included.
